%%% note
try の中で map の関数が失敗するとき。並び (VSeq) のまま返すと誤りが try の外で出てしまう (ADR 105)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import try from dw::Runtime
output application/json
---
try(() -> payload map (if ($ == 2) dw::Runtime::fail("x") else $)).success
%%% input payload application/json
[1, 2, 3]
%%% output application/json
false
